# Shared variables for all bots — stored in Vault at
# secret/data/wispace-bots/shared/prd (KV v2 API path).
# Loaded at runtime by the shared @wispace/bot-common Vault loader.
#
# To update a value: Vault UI/API/CLI → secret/data/wispace-bots/shared/prd.
# This file is only a local-development reference; production does not need it.
#
# Full list of Vault-stored shared variables:
#   WISPACE_INTERNAL_KEY, WISPACE_API_VERIFY_TOKEN_URL, WISPACE_API_*
#   WISPACE_API_LINK_STATUS_URL, WISPACE_LINK_STATUS_ENABLED,
#   WISPACE_API_LINK_STATUS_TIMEOUT_MS, WISPACE_API_MAX_RETRIES,
#   WISPACE_API_RETRY_BASE_DELAY_MS
#   PLATFORM_LINK_AUDIT_CLEANUP_ENABLED, PLATFORM_LINK_AUDIT_RETENTION_DAYS
#   OPENAI_API_KEY, OPENAI_MODEL, OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_API_KEY, OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_MODEL, OPENAI_COMPATIBLE_BASE_URL, OPENROUTER_*, MINIMAX_*
#   DB_HOST, DB_PORT, DB_NAME, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, DB_SSL
#   REDIS_*, LLM_*, CHAT_CLARIFICATION_*, THROTTLE_*, OUTBOUND_RATE_LIMIT_*
#   STUDY_REMINDER_*, CHAT_USAGE_TIMEZONE, MIGRATION_LOCK_ID
#   DATA_QUALITY_* (daily read-only anomaly checks; production cron at 09:15 ICT)
#   BACKUP_ENCRYPTION_PASSPHRASE, INTERNAL_API_KEY, WEB_ACTIVITY_GATE_ENABLED, WEB_ACTIVITY_DORMANT_DAYS, etc.
